  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Default behavior",
      "items": [
        "bootstrap_enabled=false and target=null yield zero AWS resources and null outputs. The conditional arrow is not an activation.",
        "The state bucket and key are separate from synthetic reports; both resources have prevent_destroy guards."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Access contract only",
      "items": [
        "Native S3 .tflock; one default-workspace state key. State Get/Put; lock Get/Put/Delete; scoped KMS via this bucket.",
        "Outputs create no role, policy resource, attachment, trust, usable credentials or active backend. Atlantis denies this root."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Evidence and ownership",
      "items": [
        "Terraform/Terragrunt own this future storage graph. Tests enable it only with synthetic fixtures and mocked providers.",
        "Default zero-resource real-provider check was network-blocked in G2-A. No AWS identity/API, apply, backend migration or webhook was verified."
      ]
    }
  ]
